"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Comprehensive Power Tools:** Power off, Reboot, UserSpace Reboot, ldrestart, Safe Mode, Respring, uicache, and Lock device.\n- **System Information:** Display Wi-Fi IP, Global IP, uptime, and RAM usage right inside the Control Center.\n- **Broad Compatibility:** Full support from iOS 11 up to the latest versions across Rootful, Rootless, and RootHide environments (unc0ver, Electra, Dopamine, Taurine, palera1n, etc.).\n- **Flexible Customization:** Easily configure all options right inside the native Settings app.",
