{
"markdown": "### Version 1.5.0\n- Support: iOS 11 - 26 (rootful / rootless / roothide), tested with Electra, unc0ver, Odyssey, Taurine, palera1n, Dopamine and Relaxin.\n- New: App icon, Control Center icon and launch screen.\n- New: Launch animation in the app and an animated rotating header in Settings.\n- Added: A small background helper (powerselectord) so Control Center and Power Slider actions work on iOS 15 and later.\n- Improved: UserSpace Reboot now works on every jailbreak on iOS 13 and later (uses ldrestart on iOS 12 and earlier).\n- Improved: Shows a loading indicator when running UserSpace Reboot or \"Kill CommCenter & mediaserverd\".\n- Fixed: UserSpace Reboot did nothing on palera1n or caused a crash / kernel panic.\n- Changed: \"Display uptime\" in Control Center is now on by default; leftover config files are cleaned up when uninstalling on rootless/roothide.",
"useSpacing": true,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
},
